{"language": "en", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.06, "text": "This is how to get people addicted to your storytelling,"}, {"start": 2.24, "end": 4.42, "text": "even if you talk about super boring topics."}, {"start": 4.78, "end": 6.5, "text": "It's called the illusion of novelty."}, {"start": 6.72, "end": 9.1, "text": "And this one framework is the ultimate storytelling hack"}, {"start": 9.1, "end": 10.48, "text": "for boring businesses."}, {"start": 10.78, "end": 12.14, "text": "Step one is the new reveal."}, {"start": 12.32, "end": 14.06, "text": "The first thing you have to do to make a boring topic"}, {"start": 14.06, "end": 17.2, "text": "feel new is reveal that something has changed about it."}, {"start": 17.28, "end": 19.28, "text": "Let's say I make content about drinking water,"}, {"start": 19.44, "end": 20.36, "text": "the most boring topic ever."}, {"start": 20.5, "end": 22.2, "text": "If I say drinking water is good for you,"}, {"start": 22.3, "end": 23.42, "text": "well then I've lost your attention"}, {"start": 23.42, "end": 24.58, "text": "because you already knew that."}, {"start": 24.68, "end": 26.36, "text": "But instead if I say there's new research"}, {"start": 26.36, "end": 28.94, "text": "that says drinking water at a specific time of day"}, {"start": 28.94, "end": 30.84, "text": "will give you more energy than coffee."}, {"start": 31.04, "end": 33.04, "text": "All of a sudden I just revealed something new"}, {"start": 33.04, "end": 34.32, "text": "about that old topic."}, {"start": 34.54, "end": 36.96, "text": "Now step two in the framework is called contrast framing."}, {"start": 37.14, "end": 38.62, "text": "And this is when you take that new reveal"}, {"start": 38.62, "end": 41.46, "text": "and position it against the old way of thinking."}, {"start": 41.62, "end": 43.56, "text": "So in the water example, I might say something like this."}, {"start": 43.72, "end": 45.56, "text": "Everyone knows you should drink eight cups of water"}, {"start": 45.56, "end": 46.52, "text": "per day to stay healthy."}, {"start": 46.66, "end": 48.28, "text": "Well it turns out that number is made up"}, {"start": 48.28, "end": 49.4, "text": "and what actually matters more"}, {"start": 49.4, "end": 51.1, "text": "isn't how much you drink but when."}, {"start": 51.28, "end": 53.02, "text": "See now I've created a comparative relationship"}, {"start": 53.02, "end": 54.42, "text": "between what you currently believe,"}, {"start": 54.64, "end": 57.12, "text": "the amount of water and my new reveal, the timing."}, {"start": 57.12, "end": 58.74, "text": "And this makes you a lot more curious"}, {"start": 58.74, "end": 60.66, "text": "to see if my new reveal is true."}, {"start": 60.92, "end": 62.66, "text": "Step three in the framework is called urgency."}, {"start": 63.0, "end": 64.96, "text": "And I like to refer to this as the turbo button."}, {"start": 65.14, "end": 66.82, "text": "If you really want to make your stories 10 out of 10"}, {"start": 66.82, "end": 70.4, "text": "addicting, you should add urgency on top of your new reveal."}, {"start": 70.52, "end": 72.32, "text": "And this is usually something based around timeliness."}, {"start": 72.58, "end": 73.56, "text": "Something just happened"}, {"start": 73.56, "end": 75.52, "text": "or something is about to close forever."}, {"start": 75.7, "end": 76.4, "text": "So for the water example,"}, {"start": 76.5, "end": 78.96, "text": "it could be something like a new study just published"}, {"start": 78.96, "end": 81.34, "text": "that shows the timeliness of drinking water matters."}, {"start": 81.62, "end": 83.12, "text": "That new study creates urgency"}, {"start": 83.12, "end": 85.26, "text": "which amplifies the effect of the reveal."}, {"start": 85.26, "end": 86.08, "text": "Now the last step,"}, {"start": 86.2, "end": 88.36, "text": "step four in the framework is called bullseye proof"}, {"start": 88.36, "end": 90.6, "text": "because the last mile of getting this whole thing to work"}, {"start": 90.6, "end": 92.0, "text": "is making the viewer believe"}, {"start": 92.0, "end": 93.56, "text": "that your new reveal is true."}, {"start": 93.7, "end": 95.24, "text": "So this is where you layer on some proof"}, {"start": 95.24, "end": 97.58, "text": "to justify why the viewer should believe you."}, {"start": 97.74, "end": 100.34, "text": "That professional study is the thing that seals the deal."}, {"start": 100.48, "end": 103.26, "text": "Without proof, your wild claim reveal may fall flat."}, {"start": 103.36, "end": 104.62, "text": "So this is an insurance policy."}, {"start": 104.8, "end": 106.16, "text": "Those four steps combine together"}, {"start": 106.16, "end": 108.34, "text": "to create the illusion that something is novel"}, {"start": 108.34, "end": 109.72, "text": "even if it's actually boring."}, {"start": 109.86, "end": 111.76, "text": "Comment novelty and I'll send you a full breakdown"}, {"start": 111.76, "end": 113.5, "text": "of this framework with more examples"}, {"start": 113.5, "end": 115.76, "text": "and the Claude skill that you can feed in"}, {"start": 115.76, "end": 117.9, "text": "to automatically apply it to your own scripts."}], "words": [{"w": "This", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.14}, {"w": "is", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.26}, {"w": "how", "start": 0.26, "end": 0.32}, {"w": "to", "start": 0.32, "end": 0.38}, {"w": "get", "start": 0.38, "end": 0.46}, {"w": "people", "start": 0.46, "end": 0.72}, {"w": "addicted", "start": 0.72, "end": 1.24}, {"w": "to", "start": 1.24, "end": 1.48}, {"w": "your", "start": 1.48, "end": 1.58}, {"w": "storytelling,", "start": 1.58, "end": 2.06}, {"w": "even", "start": 2.24, "end": 2.48}, {"w": "if", "start": 2.48, "end": 2.64}, {"w": "you", "start": 2.64, "end": 2.74}, {"w": "talk", "start": 2.74, "end": 3.0}, {"w": "about", "start": 3.0, "end": 3.24}, {"w": "super", "start": 3.24, "end": 3.66}, {"w": "boring", "start": 3.66, "end": 4.0}, {"w": "topics.", "start": 4.0, "end": 4